<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
  <head>
    <title>404 | Страница не найдена | Т-Банк</title>
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/system/favicon.png" type="image/png" />
    <style>
      @font-face {
        font-family: "haas";
        src: url("/system/fonts/NeueHaasUnicaW1G-Regular.woff2") format("woff2"),
          url("/system/fonts/NeueHaasUnicaW1G-Regular.woff") format("woff"),
          url("/system/fonts/NeueHaasUnicaW1G-Regular.eot") format("eot"),
          url("/system/fonts/NeueHaasUnicaW1G-Regular.ttf") format("ttf");
        font-weight: 400;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      @font-face {
        font-family: "TinkoffSans";
        src: url("/system/fonts/TinkoffSans.woff2") format("woff2"),
          url("/system/fonts/TinkoffSans.woff") format("woff");
        font-weight: 400;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      html {
        font-family: sans-serif;
        -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      }

      body {
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
        background: #ffffff;
        color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
        font-family: haas, pragmatica, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
          Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }

      a {
        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
      }

      img {
        border-style: none;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .page {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        min-height: 100vh;
        min-height: -webkit-fill-available;
      }

      .logo {
        display: block;
        padding: 10px 16px;
      }

      .logo__box {
        width: 96px;
        height: 96px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        border-radius: 31.25%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .logo__box img {
        width: 96px;
        display: block;
      }

      .hero {
        position: relative;
        height: 184px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .hero img {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        display: block;
        max-width: none;
      }

      .hero--desktop {
        display: none;
      }

      .title {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 42px 16px 8px;
        text-align: center;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 20px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }

      .subtitle {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0 16px;
        text-align: center;
        line-height: 18px;
      }

      .links {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        margin: 40px 0 0;
        padding: 0 8px;
      }

      .links a {
        display: block;
        padding: 4px;
        line-height: 18px;
        color: #428bf9;
        text-decoration: none;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .links a:hover {
        color: #126df7;
      }

      .links a:active {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      .banner {
        position: relative;
        margin: 52px 16px 10px;
        background: #e2e8f0;
        border-radius: 24px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .banner__info {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 24px 20px 0;
      }

      .banner__icon {
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        border-radius: 31.25%;
        background: #ffdd2d;
        overflow: hidden;
        flex: none;
      }

      .banner__icon img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
      }

      .banner__icon .banner__icon-desktop {
        display: none;
      }

      .banner__title {
        margin: 24px 0 0;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 17px;
        line-height: 20px;
      }

      .banner__subtitle {
        margin: 12px 0 0;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 16px;
      }

      .banner__button {
        margin: 28px 0 0;
      }

      .banner__button a {
        display: block;
      }

      .banner__button img {
        display: block;
        max-width: 100%;
        height: auto;
      }

      .banner__button .banner__button-ios {
        display: none;
      }

      .ios .banner__button .banner__button-android {
        display: none;
      }

      .ios .banner__button .banner__button-ios {
        display: block;
      }

      .banner__more {
        display: none;
      }

      .banner__image {
        position: relative;
        height: 200px;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin: 32px -20px 0;
      }

      .banner__image img {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 0;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        display: block;
        max-width: none;
      }

      .banner__image--desktop {
        display: none;
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
        .logo {
          padding: 12px 24px 0;
        }

        .hero {
          height: auto;
          width: 100%;
          max-width: 432px;
          margin: 16px auto 0;
          overflow: visible;
        }

        .hero img {
          position: static;
          transform: none;
          width: 100%;
          height: auto;
          margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .hero--mobile {
          display: none;
        }

        .hero--desktop {
          display: block;
        }

        .title {
          padding: 40px 24px 8px;
          font-family: TinkoffSans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI,
            Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
          font-weight: 500;
          font-size: 36px;
          line-height: 40px;
        }

        .subtitle {
          padding: 0 24px;
          line-height: 24px;
        }

        .links {
          flex-direction: row;
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          justify-content: center;
          margin-top: 24px;
          padding: 0 24px;
        }

        .links a {
          padding: 0 6px;
          line-height: 24px;
          color: #126df7;
        }

        .links a:hover {
          color: #165eca;
        }

        .banner {
          width: calc(100% - 48px);
          max-width: 1104px;
          margin: 88px auto 32px;
        }

        .banner__info {
          align-items: flex-start;
          text-align: left;
          max-width: 524px;
          box-sizing: border-box;
          min-height: 500px;
          padding: 40px 48px 48px;
        }

        .banner__icon {
          width: 120px;
          height: 120px;
          margin-bottom: 64px;
        }

        .banner__icon .banner__icon-mobile {
          display: none;
        }

        .banner__icon .banner__icon-desktop {
          display: block;
        }

        .banner__title {
          margin-top: auto;
          font-family: TinkoffSans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI,
            Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
          font-weight: 500;
          font-size: 36px;
          line-height: 40px;
        }

        .banner__subtitle {
          font-size: 15px;
          line-height: 24px;
        }

        .banner__button {
          display: none;
        }

        .banner__more {
          display: block;
          margin: 40px 0 0;
        }

        .banner__more a {
          display: inline-block;
          padding: 12px 16px;
          background: #ffffff;
          border-radius: 8px;
          color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
          font-size: 15px;
          line-height: 20px;
          text-decoration: none;
        }

        .banner__more a:hover {
          background: #f6f7f8;
        }

        .banner__more a:active {
          background: #eaecee;
        }

        .banner__image {
          position: absolute;
          right: 0;
          bottom: 0;
          height: auto;
          margin: 0;
          overflow: visible;
          max-width: 55%;
        }

        .banner__image img {
          position: static;
          transform: none;
          max-width: 100%;
          display: block;
        }

        .banner__image--mobile {
          display: none;
        }

        .banner__image--desktop {
          display: block;
        }
      }
    </style>
    <script>
      if (
        /iPhone|iPad|iPod/.test(navigator.userAgent) ||
        (navigator.platform === "MacIntel" && navigator.maxTouchPoints > 1)
      ) {
        document.documentElement.className += " ios";
      }
    </script>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="page">
      <a class="logo" href="/" aria-label="Т-Банк">
        <span class="logo__box">
          <img src="/system/images/404-logo-wordmark.svg" alt="Т-Банк" />
        </span>
      </a>

      <div class="hero hero--mobile">
        <img class="picture" alt="404" src="/system/images/404.svg" width="311" height="118" />
      </div>
      <div class="hero hero--desktop">
        <img class="picture" alt="404" src="/system/images/404.svg" />
      </div>

      <h1 class="title">Такой страницы нет</h1>

      <p class="subtitle">Но&nbsp;есть много других полезных страниц</p>

      <nav class="links">
        <a href="/cards/credit-cards/">Кредитные карты</a>
        <a href="/cards/debit-cards/">Дебетовые карты</a>
        <a href="/savings/">Вклады</a>
        <a href="/mobile-operator/">Сим‑карта</a>
        <a href="/">tbank.ru</a>
      </nav>

      <section class="banner">
        <div class="banner__info">
          <div class="banner__icon">
            <img class="banner__icon-mobile" src="/system/images/404-app-icon-mobile.svg" alt="" />
            <img class="banner__icon-desktop" src="/system/images/404-app-icon.svg" alt="" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="banner__title">Мобильное приложение Т‑Банка</h3>
          <p class="banner__subtitle">
            Проверяйте баланс, оплачивайте услуги, получайте помощь в&nbsp;чате
            <nobr>24/7</nobr>
          </p>

          <div class="banner__button">
            <a
              title="Подробнее"
              href="/apps/?internal_source=page404"
            >
              <img
                class="banner__button-android"
                src="/system/images/404-store-button.svg"
                alt="Скачать приложение"
              />
              <img
                class="banner__button-ios"
                src="/system/images/404-store-button-ios.svg"
                alt="Скачать приложение"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="banner__more">
            <a
              aria-label="Подробнее об установке приложений Т-Банка"
              href="/apps/?internal_source=page404"
            >Подробнее</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="banner__image banner__image--mobile">
          <img src="/system/images/404-app-phone-mobile.png" srcset="/system/images/404-app-phone-mobile-2x.png 2x" alt="" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="banner__image banner__image--desktop">
          <img src="/system/images/404-app-phone.png" srcset="/system/images/404-app-phone-2x.png 2x" alt="" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    <script src="/system/script.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
